{"articleNo":"105158","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=105158&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"생활관(푸름관) 식당 음식물 줄이기 캠페인 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.04.10","hit":"2920","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font><font color=\"#0900ff\">&lt;음식물 쓰레기 줄이기 캠페인&gt;</font></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">행사명 : 음식물 쓰레기를 줄이면 지구가 살아납니다!</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">행사기간 : 2014년 4월 14일(월) ~ 4월 18일(금)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">행사장소 : 푸름관 식당</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">행사방법 :&nbsp;<font color=\"#0900ff\">하루 잔반량 120kg이하(잔반1통)로 될 경우 돌아오는 같은 요일에 후식 추가</font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (예. 월요일에 120kg이하일 경우 다음주 월요일에 후식 추가)</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2014.4.</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 금오공과대학교 생활관 </span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
